"To run the template, first generate the python module from the Designer "
"myCalendar.ui file by typing <userinput>pyuic4 -o myCalendar.py myCalendar."
"ui</userinput> in your project folder and then start your project: "
"<userinput>python APPNAME.py</userinput>."
